# Cloudflare Pages redirects (the origin since the 2026-08-02 cutover).

# /reviews/ removed 2026-08-17 — it carried six fabricated testimonials (docs/business-facts.md §B).
# Returns as a real page once verifiable reviews exist.
/reviews /about/ 301
/reviews/* /about/ 301

# The 404 route emits three ways: /404.html (which Pages serves natively as the custom 404) plus
# two crawlable directory forms with identical thin content (backlog §1.1). Collapse them onto the
# homepage so they cannot be indexed as near-duplicates. /404.html itself is NOT redirected — Pages
# needs it to serve real 404 responses.
/404/ / 301
/_not-found/ / 301
